   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dealing Dispair**: back after 184 archived shows (801 days); rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Sally Goodin'**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **No More Leave You Behind**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Sorrow is a Highway**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **To Lay Me Down**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Blue Mule**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-11-08.nak300.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 142 min [1]. Said about its sound: Volume was boosted by 3 dB across the whole first set, with an extra 1 dB on several tracks (3, 5, 7, 8, 9); Second-set tracks 1 through 6 and the encore were raised by 2 dB in volume [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-11-08.nak300.flac16**: taped by Steve Baker; source: FOB Nakamichi cm300's w/CP-1 capsules>Marantz pmd661 MKII 16/44.1 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Jefferson Theater - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/jefferson-theater/) [3]",
